65","sourceWorkId":"21436","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ファミレス『ロイヤルキャスト」のウェイトレスとして働いている少女。基本的には明るくさっぱりとした性格だが、可愛らしい容姿とは裏腹に勝ち気な一面もあり、気に入らない相手にはとことん容赦しない。最悪な出会いをしてしまった十弥に対して最初は冷たく接していたが、ともに働く内に少しずつ打ち解けていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ボク、冗談キライだから。 キミのことはもっとキライだけどね」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※あかりの一人称はボクとあたしから選択できます。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"160332"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f50293f212829449c757a79b6afa7ce013520168840615f1b017893fedfa1653.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4f8a32fc8685032774c9c978ad07d51f1a14bda5cde54f5966de03dfdb423a0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"貴坂理緒","creatorId":"vndb:s946","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s946","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s946","name":"貴坂 理緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:435297:160332:15550:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:501857:160332:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62782","characterName":"伴藤 省吾","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["5666"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62782"},"originalCharacterName":"伴藤 省吾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"十弥がバイトをはじめてしばらくしてからロイヤルキャストで働くことになる男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口がうまい上に見た目も悪くなく、スポーツ万能ということもあり、学生時代から女性には非常にモテていて、常に複数の女性と遊びで関係を持っ